{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And He said.</b> The Gaon [Saadia] says this is like \"and YHWH relented\" (Exodus 32:14), for He said He would destroy everything, and the meaning is: I will not blot out from My book, but rather [only] whoever has sinned against Me in his thought — after the manner of \"in order to seize the house of Israel in their hearts\" (Ezekiel 14:5). And they were not killed, for they did not worship [it], and this is \"and YHWH struck the people because they had made the calf,\" and a doubt arises concerning those [who sinned] in secret."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:56.175713661Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}